<!DOCTYPE html>
<!--
  Design Preview Template
  Mal for statisk preview-side som vises til kunde FØR Sprint 1.
  AI fyller placeholders med data fra kickstart-wizarden.

  Plassholdere AI MÅ fylle ut:
    {{client_name}}, {{tagline}}, {{cta_primary}}, {{cta_secondary}}
    {{color_primary}}, {{color_secondary}}
    {{font_heading}}, {{font_body}}
    {{design_direction}}  (brukes som BODY class for stil-variant)
-->
<html lang="nb" data-direction="{{design_direction}}">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>{{client_name}} — Design Preview</title>
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow" />

  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family={{font_heading}}:wght@400;700;900&family={{font_body}}:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />

  <style>
    :root {
      --color-primary: {{color_primary}};
      --color-secondary: {{color_secondary}};
      --color-bg: #ffffff;
      --color-fg: #0a0a0a;
      --color-muted: #6b7280;
      --font-heading: '{{font_heading}}', serif;
      --font-body: '{{font_body}}', sans-serif;
      --radius: 12px;
      --space-section: clamp(4rem, 3rem + 5vw, 10rem);
    }

    [data-theme="dark"] {
      --color-bg: #0a0a0a;
      --color-fg: #fafafa;
      --color-muted: #9ca3af;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    body {
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      background: var(--color-bg);
      color: var(--color-fg);
      line-height: 1.6;
      transition: background 200ms, color 200ms;
    }

    h1, h2, h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      line-height: 1.1;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    a { color: var(--color-primary); text-decoration: none; }
    a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

    /* Nav */
    nav {
      position: sticky; top: 0;
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
      padding: 1.25rem clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-bg) 80%, transparent);
      border-bottom: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-fg) 8%, transparent);
      z-index: 10;
    }
    nav .brand { font-family: var(--font-heading); font-weight: 900; font-size: 1.25rem; }
    nav .links { display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; align-items: center; }
    nav .links a { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--color-fg); }
    nav .toggle {
      background: var(--color-primary); color: white;
      border: none; padding: 0.5rem 1rem; border-radius: var(--radius);
      cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;
    }

    /* Hero */
    .hero {
      min-height: 90vh;
      display: grid; place-items: center;
      padding: var(--space-section) clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
      text-align: center;
      position: relative; overflow: hidden;
    }
    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(3rem, 1rem + 7vw, 8rem);
      font-weight: 900;
      max-width: 18ch; margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .hero p.tagline {
      font-size: clamp(1.125rem, 0.5rem + 1vw, 1.5rem);
      color: var(--color-muted);
      max-width: 50ch; margin: 1.5rem auto 0;
    }
    .hero .cta-row {
      display: flex; gap: 1rem; justify-content: center; margin-top: 2.5rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .cta {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;
      padding: 0.875rem 1.75rem; border-radius: var(--radius);
      font-weight: 600; font-size: 1rem;
      transition: transform 150ms;
    }
    .cta:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }
    .cta-primary { background: var(--color-primary); color: white; }
    .cta-secondary { background: transparent; color: var(--color-fg); border: 1.5px solid var(--color-fg); }

    /* Variant: Dark Luxury Motion */
    [data-direction*="Dark Luxury"] {
      --color-bg: #0a0a0a;
      --color-fg: #fafafa;
      --color-muted: #a1a1aa;
    }
    [data-direction*="Dark Luxury"] .hero::before {
      content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at 20% 30%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-primary) 30%, transparent), transparent 60%);
      z-index: -1;
    }

    /* Variant: Editorial Bento — store grids */
    [data-direction*="Editorial"] .hero h1 {
      text-align: left; max-width: none; padding-left: 1rem;
      border-left: 6px solid var(--color-primary);
    }
    [data-direction*="Editorial"] .hero { text-align: left; }

    /* Variant: Brutalism Refined */
    [data-direction*="Brutalism"] {
      --radius: 0;
    }
    [data-direction*="Brutalism"] .cta-primary {
      border: 3px solid var(--color-fg);
      box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 var(--color-fg);
    }

    /* Variant: Swiss Minimal Refined */
    [data-direction*="Swiss"] .hero h1 {
      font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    }

    /* Mid sections */
    section.features {
      padding: var(--space-section) clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      gap: 2rem;
      max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .feature {
      padding: 2.5rem 2rem; border-radius: var(--radius);
      background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-fg) 4%, var(--color-bg));
    }
    .feature h3 { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
    .feature p { color: var(--color-muted); }

    section.statement {
      padding: var(--space-section) clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
      max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;
    }
    section.statement blockquote {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 1rem + 2vw, 3.5rem);
      font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }
    section.statement cite {
      display: block; margin-top: 2rem; font-style: normal;
      color: var(--color-muted); font-size: 1rem;
    }

    /* Footer */
    footer {
      padding: 4rem clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 4rem) 2rem;
      border-top: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-fg) 8%, transparent);
    }
    footer .grid {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
      gap: 2rem; max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto;
    }
    footer h4 { font-size: 0.875rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    footer ul { list-style: none; }
    footer li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--color-muted); font-size: 0.95rem; }
    footer .credit {
      max-width: 1400px; margin: 3rem auto 0; padding-top: 2rem;
      border-top: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-fg) 8%, transparent);
      text-align: center; font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--color-muted);
    }
    footer .credit a { font-weight: 600; }

    /* Preview-banner */
    .preview-banner {
      position: fixed; top: 1rem; right: 1rem; z-index: 100;
      background: var(--color-primary); color: white;
      padding: 0.5rem 1rem; border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 16px color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-primary) 40%, transparent);
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="preview-banner">🎨 Design Preview · Ikke endelig</div>

  <nav>
    <div class="brand">{{client_name}}</div>
    <div class="links">
      <a href="#">Forside</a>
      <a href="#">Tjenester</a>
      <a href="#">Om oss</a>
      <a href="#">Blogg</a>
      <a href="#">Kontakt</a>
      <button class="toggle" onclick="document.body.dataset.theme = document.body.dataset.theme === 'dark' ? 'light' : 'dark'">🌓</button>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <section class="hero">
    <div>
      <h1>{{tagline}}</h1>
      <p class="tagline">{{client_name}} leverer noe ekte. Ikke en mal — en idé.</p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a href="#" class="cta cta-primary">{{cta_primary}}</a>
        <a href="#" class="cta cta-secondary">{{cta_secondary}}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="features">
    <div class="feature">
      <h3>Først av sitt slag</h3>
      <p>Vi bygger ikke på samme mal som alle andre. Du får noe som ser ut som DEG.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature">
      <h3>Bygget for å vare</h3>
      <p>10/10 ytelse, tilgjengelig, og enkel å vedlikeholde. Ikke en tikkende bombe.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature">
      <h3>Du eier alt</h3>
      <p>Kode, design, data. Ingen lock-in. Ingen overraskelser om 3 år.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="statement">
    <blockquote>«Endelig en samarbeidspartner som tar designet på alvor.»</blockquote>
    <cite>— Plassholder for ekte testimonial fra kunde</cite>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <div class="grid">
      <div>
        <h4>Kontakt</h4>
        <ul>
          <li>hei@{{client_name_slug}}.no</li>
          <li>+47 ...</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>Følg oss</h4>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="#">Instagram</a></li>
          <li><a href="#">LinkedIn</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>Selskap</h4>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="#">Om oss</a></li>
          <li><a href="#">Personvern</a></li>
          <li><a href="#">Tilgjengelighet</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="credit">
      Utviklet av <a href="https://mlit.no" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Myrvoll-Lunde IT Drift</a> ·
      Designretning: {{design_direction}}
    </p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
